        "The source evidence is the birth and cancellation of pairs. A raw crossing count changes, but a signed total can stay fixed. Orientation is what makes the plus or minus mean something rather than being arithmetic pasted onto a picture. This same protected-total idea will return when vector-field defects are counted by index.",
